<item>
<title>挖掘机拆西安政务中心  网民称“反向强拆”  新京报视频遭删除11月9日，西安一名47岁男子驾挖掘机开进西咸新区政务服务</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10494</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10494</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:10:46 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>挖掘机拆西安政务中心  网民称“反向强拆”  新京报视频遭删除</b><br/><br/>11月9日，西安一名47岁男子驾挖掘机开进西咸新区政务服务中心，拆毁门头。据中媒报道，至少6处建筑结构受损。警方称胡某某已被采取刑事强制措施，无人受伤，官方通报未说明动机。<br/><br/>据中国数字时代，网传原因有三，均未证实：被拖欠工程款、不满养殖场拆迁补偿、回迁和过渡费被拖欠。据港媒报道，当地工作人员称无关工程款，称胡某某的养殖场已按政策赔偿，但他对赔偿不满。有媒体指出，官方应说明双方分歧及有无正常协调。<br/><br/>据李老师，《新京报》视频发布不久被作者删除。网民称胡某某为“挖掘机勇士”，认为他报复对准政府、没有伤及无辜；也有人称这是“反向强拆”。目前国内针对此事的视频和讨论受到严格审查。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83">#维权</a> <a href="?q=%23%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89">#西安</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《澎湃新闻》<a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34442911" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">陕西西安警方通报一政务服务中心门头遭挖掘机破坏：嫌疑人胡某某（男，47岁）已被采取刑事强制措施</a><br/>《东网》<a href="https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261110/bkn-20261110131157582-1110_00822_001.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">男子驾挖掘机毁政务中心 传长期信访不满致过激行为</a><br/>《中国数字时代》<a href="https://chinadigitaltimes.net/chinese/733778.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">【CDTV】西安挖掘机勇士“反向强拆”：冤有头债有主，这次真找了政府</a><br/>《联合早报》<a href="https://www.zaokanbao.com/news/china/202611/1085237.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">下午察：当有人开挖掘机破坏政务中心</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/PzpaRT3wSUvRF_p7sc2nXsy4TZjxrRxNpqsAM9fz37PXkzNk_Si5TPbT-aRkdjAcn-P8RP_oN-Tyun-a54NfGBdDd-7oDXV-UczbE56oiA34aOidjvjdlG2A5lqcsE5pxbNw4xfzlI42lp5a5wTCZ4MWwkt2ZgsYldQ1TRyINwD2bPdNfdNtUgpxndqXIveIUHsa9JHk3QHf98b8qYNUrUZv3tpD4f9jFN0w0l6d-Av4uoBdlOGMw7zgrvijKPQU-1UrAtUWhtf8rvq-MkQDdIjOD_-ESRLILfDg2BGefa-Nrej26POCWG_sDEemy2fvOdxghHrAbCld3BDpweYrNA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/ZVwNJYalg2kWB6cEyKAb59-tHjfkdcVP_VcFuC0LxOfzzQAOm7M-uzgjyjkTT9ZqYx9iL5vWzup5a_tQQl_JFHHU8F2AQTehwtJzKHz1fVkBYaeSap8r3mAhxt0cKOkWGJn57fBwf6Q0jntIzaz-vzWmAXgqaT3_KxrVmMoxn1GsjD37qc30zDauY5NUCn8njq7sLqhWEUZtf_3VImJVciIdWxBn1tCINja46GEn78xDRdxmXom52UrUni8evhM4MYh9OJBJnnlEAsfe2QRlgZ6NV1TSVqKMdjLEetG_Sl8_1UbS0P2BoySC-JMMUweFfyM9-1qWyvdgqWSYCTOX-w.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/NF0WCQIPAfrIQIYSGIPyA-fJAWpuz3Ttjy87WLxAez940B8yjwcWVuOyOXnOUOFhzJsYZxDd1TD5B2gElTUjx5Oq_7__5uAnBSRlkrNKnQW5upKlT8sTKEnUO_OrJt5K1gybuxVRwTn5uxhE3rtsR-at1w6SnPxFHNA-V7DsXcC23KZcd0uP01eRGQdckPjDymW-aM2UbXhnDp7VXG4zil9ZkWmugucyzbv8y5ZzVbYwU7puJLEWuzwbQMoV9RxNdKbVxUMNwGXN4wJfsoi9_IbAUV7ep-JZ1-LMKDsSBKxRR9DNHyKjWlAbZPLv3uMJ3wbZUUoEZTWn3g6V54wNCg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/VOeWlAjqrptCpZmsN5mK--E3FngpxW_utIeecPEDk8I1Z4I5TgOg6yVJDO2I2H8byAx8rnoEvg6XtqDZxb5mQXs1kwUWFPhOJNdSRDoQ3DGx4Vm9UcTxGgth5ryYcNfSLp64Q729C2lpNT6MZ-sLwri081k_ArUYoFv8hbqmvVS2gq7l0_8JOTiRzWh4JMrAXbxYkABFNOKJmK3LyMFe91TbmDH2ast3Byc4n78LmPrpd1_Iqix3XfhWWbg6opgBVLsUF5g4VqS32xc8paF73DXf-UeD2S7-clAJr53aW9_00rXNCvQxiPREXfXhClqSU9P6T-07Sb4jAPQmPaNDaQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8E89.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.pn